  "projects": [
   {
    "title": "Agent Skills",
    "description": "An open-source collection of Agent Skills, self-contained tools that plug into any coding-agent harness (Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode/OMP, GitHub Copilot CLI) with no vendor lock-in and no dependency on each other or on my own setup. The flagship skill so far, Swarm, lets an agent fan a task out to many cheaper agents under a hard spend cap, verifies every result independently rather than trusting an agent's own claim of success, and gets a second model family to review the diff before anything merges... same behavior whichever harness is driving it. Built to the same bar throughout: tested standalone (300+ tests), documented design decisions, MIT licensed.",
